WEBVTT

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:11.580
War.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:28.000
Yes, war never changes,
regardless of era.

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:39.000
But still...

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:45.330
Big Sis! What is that thing?!

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:49.200
I have a really bad feeling about this.

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:59.000
It's a little similar to a Fritz X.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.160
A bliss? Bullin? What?

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:07.000
That's not a bad guess, Eugen.
What you see is a weapon from the future.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.660
The concept of a weapon that is
just a bit beyond your reach.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.660
That weapon...

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:19.040
Are you all right?!

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:22.200
We have to stop that thing...

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.870
That's what obliterated the island earlier!

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:02.250
What a malevolent presence...

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:18.700
Where is it headed?

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:23.620
Can it reach the base? From here?

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:38.120
Destroy the enemy unilaterally
from as far away as possible.

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:41.080
That is the nature of
the evolution of weaponry.

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:46.120
The power to annihilate the enemy's
headquarters itself from across the ocean.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:52.450
Yes... The power to repel the enemies
that seek to intrude on my love.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.660
Almost there... Almost there!

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:25.120
Let's play, Enterprise!

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:04.120
Behind you!

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.370
Get out of my way!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.870
Bring it on!

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:48.700
Looks like I win, Enterprise!

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:49.750
Huh?

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:54.790
I will shoot it down...

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:04.870
What...?!

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:11.250
Big Sis!

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:36.870
Now we're talking!
This is what war's all about!

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:46.160
What have we built...?

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:51.950
This power was supposed to
protect Sakura Empire.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:55.040
It is your cowardice
that rejected the <i>Orochi</i>.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:58.950
Lies! What can a power like this
ever hope to protect?!

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:03.540
Do you desire the end of the world, Kaga?

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:05.870
It doesn't matter anymore.

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:08.120
Kaga!

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:10.660
I said, it does matter.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:15.450
This is not what Akagi wanted.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:18.290
What can you possibly know about my dear sister?

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:23.080
Akagi can be a bit scary...
But she loves the Sakura Empire.

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.910
Kaga, you, too...

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:28.750
Silence! The only thing she loves
in me is the shadow of Amagi!

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:30.370
Even still, I...

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.000
Ayanami!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.000
Ayanami!

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:43.250
Yes, my love.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:47.200
My love will burn the world and keep blazing...

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.620
Don't let them fire that thing!

00:06:57.620 --> 00:06:59.160
Stop it, no matter what!

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:07.620
Everyone, concentrate fire on the <i>Orochi</i>!

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.700
This is Sakura Empire's responsibility.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.700
We will take the <i>Orochi </i>down
with our own hands!

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:29.870
No... We can't get through...!

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:31.950
How is that fair?

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:33.580
I won't give up...!

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:37.450
My sister put her life on the line to stop it.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:39.700
It's now or never!

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:44.200
The ocean, so cold...

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:48.040
Yes, after all, for me, the ocean is...

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:52.870
Correct. The sea lanes are painted red.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:55.250
That is our ocean.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.000
Orochi...

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:07.120
No, you're not. You are...

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:09.910
A mirror, of sorts.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:11.200
A mirror.

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:22.290
You are the physical
manifestations of human will.

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:27.330
What you're seeing is a shadow
cast from that will.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:29.410
The <i>Orochi </i>is the same.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:34.330
A mirror image created
from a shared consciousness...

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:41.040
The <i>Orochi </i>desires conflict because
that is what defines human progress.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:44.870
War never changes, regardless of era.

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:46.790
Yes, so...

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:50.200
You may end this voyage, if you desire to.

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:52.370
What if I do?

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.750
You will be freed from
the burden of seeing the future.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:11.500
Kaga!

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:15.080
A suicide attack? Fool!

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:16.120
Zuikaku!

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:24.910
What...

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.120
Enough! Wake up...

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.200
First Carrier Division!

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:48.790
This is absurd. What's the matter with you?

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:56.660
Don't you see?
They are seriously trying to save you.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:08.870
Help my dear sister Akagi.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.540
Azur Lane!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.540
Please. Help us.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:25.580
I am afraid of the ocean.

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:35.200
Every time I see battle,
my heart trembles with fear...

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:39.040
And my body is driven by one strong urge.

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:47.330
This is wrong. I must stop this.

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:52.500
The ocean is shaking?

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.750
Now what's going on?!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.250
That ship!

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:23.540
Grey Ghost!

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.910
Enterprise, engage!

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:54.700
I won't give up.

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:03.160
I'm here, carrying countless hope and will!

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:34.370
That power... Code G? No, it can't be...

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:45.410
My sister is complete nonsense, I gotta say!

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:49.580
Illustrious!

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.500
Unicorn! Are you all right?

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.790
I need everyone's help...

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:15.790
Ayanami!

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:23.080
You're all right.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:28.040
Hey! I remember you!

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:31.330
Why are you tagging along with Azur Lane?!

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:36.750
We can talk later. We have to stop Akagi.

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.620
That's what we've been
trying to do this whole time!

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:43.370
No, we all, together.

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:50.660
Ah, I see.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:53.330
Are you done talking?

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:56.910
Yes, we've come to an agreement.

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:58.500
An alliance.

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:26.950
Yes, no more rivalry! We all work together!

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:42.580
Please. I want to save Akagi.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:43.790
Of course.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:53.330
We have been awaiting your return, Enterprise.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.250
Sorry for the trouble.

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:57.290
It is nothing new.

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:07.290
These variables are unaccounted for.
I will not accept this calculation.

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:34.660
Reinforcements, now?

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.700
I'll take them on!

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:42.910
If everything is according to schedule,
they should be here...

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:44.500
Huh? What is?

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:47.790
It's time to begin this party!

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:49.250
Fire at will!

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.330
That's...!

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:05.040
Sorry for the wait! Here are
the knights of the round table!

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:16.830
I am Nagato, Nagato of Sakura Empire!

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:21.830
From this moment on, Red Axis
and Azur Lane enter into an alliance

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.200
to defeat the Sirens!

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:25.620
You knew?

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:34.200
We may live by different ideals,
but our will is the same.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:39.950
We were created to fight. We were...

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:44.250
We were created to save the world.

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:53.370
Go, warriors! Ignite your souls!

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.870
This is wrong.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:12.040
I see, Akagi..

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:15.080
You must have seen what I saw.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:17.410
That's why you're...

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:22.660
You won't stand in my way.

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:28.370
War.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:30.540
War on all of the oceans.

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:33.450
If we had another 100 years...

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:37.950
Or 50 even. Perhaps then,
we would be able to make it.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:43.410
Beyond the evolution of warfare,
we may finally be able to...

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:48.160
My love surpasses time,
overcomes the gods, and...

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:51.620
The Sakura Empire, my dear sister, Kaga...

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:55.120
I will save them all.

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:04.500
Stay away.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.660
Finally, I got you.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:36.290
Good, now you're friends.

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:38.370
Everything is good.

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:41.910
You hold the future
of Sakura Empire in your hands.

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:45.870
Everyone has to be friends, or else
we won't be able to beat the Sirens.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:24.040
The same to you, my dear sister Amagi.

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:35.450
Impressive, Azur Lane, Red Axis.

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:37.660
You've won this time.

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:40.330
Oh, a sore loser!

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:47.950
But honestly, losing the <i>Orochi</i>
was not part of your plan, was it?

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:52.080
Surpassing our expectations
is something we must welcome.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:55.580
Humanity still has a future.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:30.080
No punishment whatsoever...
That would not by acceptable.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:37.000
But this is a mistake made by
the whole of the Sakura Empire.

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:40.910
Forcing all responsibility on Akagi alone
would not be acceptable either.

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:42.950
Yes!

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:57.000
You have the hairpin, don't you?

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:10.080
I knew it. That color looks good on you.

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:26.660
This whole fiasco gives us huge
leverage over the Sakura Empire.

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:29.580
All in the name of Iron Blood's true ideals...

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:31.700
Loyalty is honor.

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:33.580
"Battleship <i>Bismarck</i>"

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:37.370
"Battleship <i>Bismarck</i>"
Only those with power can save humanity.

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:42.160
By the way, Azur Lane
gave an interesting proposal.

00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:07.700
Get to work, you.

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:11.830
Nui-nui is a harsh cat-master!

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:14.290
--Purin!
--Purin, purin!

00:22:30.620 --> 00:22:34.370
Azur Lane and Red Axis
sharing a base together...

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:37.080
That was quite a bold move.

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:41.040
The new base needs a new leader.

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:45.870
Someone symbolic, who can bridge
the two alliances together.

00:22:45.870 --> 00:22:48.580
That sounds wonderful!

00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:51.910
She might not like it so much.

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:56.200
It really is tough to have
a magnificent older sister.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:05.000
In that case... She would need a maid
to take care of daily issues.

00:23:10.910 --> 00:23:12.500
Z23!

00:23:34.330 --> 00:23:36.500
Nothing has changed.

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:40.290
One day, there will be conflict,
and you will hurt each other.

00:23:40.290 --> 00:23:44.040
War never changes, no matter the era...

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:47.370
Yes. That's why we must change instead.

00:23:54.450 --> 00:23:57.700
May the azure lanes bless you.
